   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "General rule",
   "texto": [
    "Write the full **infinitivo** and add **-ai, -as, -a, -ons, -ez, -ont**: **travailler** → **je travaillerai** (I will work).",
    "In the verbs finished in **-re**, remove the final **e**: **prendre** → **je prendrai** (I will take)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Common irregular verbs",
   "texto": [
    "They change the root, but the endings are the same: **être** → **ser-** (je serai), **avoir** → **aur-** (j-aurai), **aller** → **ir-** (j-irai), **faire** → **fer-** (je ferai)."
   ]
  },
  {
   "tipo": "explicacion",
   "titulo": "Other common roots",
   "texto": [
    "They also change **venir** → **viendr-** (je viendrai), **pouvoir** → **pourr-** (je pourrai) and **vouloir** → **voudr-** (je voudrai). The endings are still the same."
   ]
